WEBVTT

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:17.380
Sold out already?

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:18.280
Thick Pudding  Sold Out

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:20.450
Looking for a souvenir for Nanana-san?

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:23.120
Yeah. I'll just look tomorrow morning.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.850
Looks like your job went well.

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:27.320
Nope, I ended up working for nothing.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.380
But I managed to scrounge up enough

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:31.510
for my utility bill and some pudding.

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:32.460
Oh?

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:39.260
Did you wait long?

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:42.140
No problem. You're right on time.

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:45.460
I'm Tsurezure Kagetora, third-year.

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:48.530
Forgive me for the recent surprise attack.

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:50.710
Nah, I'm not worried about it.

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:53.570
The injuries President 
Yuiga gave me were worse...

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:54.110
Well, then!

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:58.030
The entire Adventure Club is together!

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:33.990
<b><u>Episode 6</u></b>

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:33.990
To the Hot Springs Town

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:31.920
I'm Hino Yumi.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.240
This is Misaki Kamome. She's new here.

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:38.130
I'm Misaki. Pleased to meet you.

00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:41.500
You've done us a great favor, Yumi-san.

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:44.040
It's nothing. Enjoy your stay.

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:47.450
Um, Tsurezure-senpai...

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:49.440
Well, if there's anything you need, just let me know.

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:49.440
What is it, Yama-kouhai?

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:52.170
How do Hino-san and President Yuiga...

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:54.020
I hear they're somewhat acquainted.

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:56.700
By the way, for Isshin, 
just seeing hands and feet

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.740
isn't enough to be "somewhat acquainted."

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:01.330
I never knew he had such a unique skill.

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:03.690
Isshin will one day be punished.

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:05.480
Get punished. Please, get punished.

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:06.450
Yuki-chan!

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:09.210
Hurry up!

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:13.290
I hear this hot spring
 makes your skin really smooth.

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:14.670
I can't wait!

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:24.140
Here you go.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:27.600
This is the room for three women.

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:30.780
Um, but I'm a boy...

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:31.660
What?

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:35.790
Don't worry about it.
 That's just a gag this idiot uses.

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:37.480
Tensai, that was mean...

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:39.530
Come on, let's just go in.

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:41.770
Ibara-senpai, that hurts...

00:03:41.770 --> 00:03:44.030
President Yuiga,
 I'd like to ask you something.

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:47.500
See, apparently, I snore pretty badly.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:50.040
Could I get a separate room to sleep in?

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:52.840
All right. I'll ask the proprietress.

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:54.010
Thanks.

00:03:56.460 --> 00:04:00.170
See? Isn't he awful?
 Isn't he evil? Isn't he a scumbag?!

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:01.670
Stupid Juugo!

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:06.050
But if he doesn't pay his utility bill, 
Juugo will be kicked out of here.

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:09.680
You could just wait a little longer for him.

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:10.430
Nope.

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:13.800
I learned my lesson from Ikusaba.

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:16.680
Anyone who's late paying 
will be immediately evicted.

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:21.530
I know that... but...

00:04:22.430 --> 00:04:24.840
Anyway, how's it going, really?

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:26.740
How's what going?

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.850
Your new roommate.

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:30.950
Well...

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:37.130
He does buy me pudding.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:39.540
I see.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:52.640
All right, let's eat our fill 
today in preparation for tomorrow.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:53.980
Let's eat!

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:06.740
What's with you, Hoshino-kouhai?

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:10.370
You've been awfully concerned with 
your own chopsticks for a while now.

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:14.150
No, it's nothing like that...

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:17.250
There's no need to lie, Hoshino-kouhai.

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:20.200
Just be honest.

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:22.760
You wonder what your
 master's spit tastes like, don't you?

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:25.500
Wh-What are you saying?!

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:28.740
Daruku, is that what
 you've been thinking?

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:30.350
I don't think that at all!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.350
There's no need to hide it.

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:36.190
Go on, stick your tongue out 
of that obscene mouth of yours,

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:39.060
and lick them from bottom to 
top to get a good taste...

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:47.170
Here, Isshin-sama.

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:51.600
Um... say, "Ahh."

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:00.960
The ruins I've located are in this house.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.520
That's close to here.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.640
What made you determine 
that there are ruins there?

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:08.300
It's owned by someone who doesn't exist.

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:10.970
No one is ever seen
 entering or leaving, either.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:11.970
Ah...

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:12.680
And...

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:14.180
Kagetora?

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.530
No problems.

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:17.970
There were no traps around the house,

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:21.470
and the key you provided 
opened the front door.

00:06:21.470 --> 00:06:23.400
We have a key?

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:26.310
I found it while researching the house.

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:29.840
Tsurezure-dono, you didn't go inside?

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:32.700
No. Isshin forbid me from going in.

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:35.310
It's dangerous to attempt anything alone.

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:38.150
So, this is the layout of the house.

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:39.370
Hmm...

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:41.970
It's two stories, and quite large.

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:45.730
Tomorrow, we'll split into two
 groups and look for the entrance.

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:49.630
This room looks suspicious.

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:51.420
Why?

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:53.360
Can't you tell by looking at the diagram?

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:54.760
What? Where?

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:04.900
The pillars on the first 
floor are not on the second.

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:08.520
Provided it's not a design flaw, 
there must be some reason.

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:09.810
I can't believe you noticed...

00:07:09.810 --> 00:07:11.680
Not bad, shrimp!

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:13.030
You're amazing, Tensai!

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:16.560
What do we do?

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:18.200
Oh, right...

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:20.410
Let's check out this room first.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.310
Meet in the lobby tomorrow
 morning at 10 AM.

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:24.770
Don't be late.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.630
<b>Women                    Men</b>

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.010
There!

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:36.130
Why don't we hit the hot spring again?

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:40.560
You know Yuki-chan?

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:43.980
Yes! Yukihime-neesan and I 
indulged in a passionate—

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:47.720
Nope. Never seen him before.

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:49.190
Let's go, Shizuka.

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:50.400
Wait, Yuki-chan...

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:51.540
Are you sure?

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:55.490
It doesn't matter if I'm sure or not.

00:07:59.150 --> 00:08:01.120
What's wrong, Juugo?

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.330
What do you mean?

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:06.630
Are you upset because
 that woman was cold to you?

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:07.340
Hardly.

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:10.230
She was the fake cop 
in the Rising Building, right?

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:11.560
That's right.

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:13.900
She's connected to your family,
 isn't she?

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:15.230
Yep.

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:18.100
Why is she here now, of all times?

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:19.640
Like I know.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:21.730
Probably just on vacation.

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:24.980
What?

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:26.610
I hope you're right.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:29.940
You're open!

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:36.490
Tensai wins!

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:59.390
Juugo!

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:14.860
I'd like it delivered today.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:16.570
All right. I'll take care of it.

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:22.630
You look sleepy.

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:25.680
Yeah, had to fill out paperwork 
to mail chilled goods.

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:27.160
Exclusive pudding.

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:29.180
A souvenir for Nanana-dono?

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:31.160
It was crazy.

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:34.660
There were people in line for it 
at 6 AM, before the store opened.

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:37.480
Well, I'm gonna go sleep a little more.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:40.010
Remember, we meet up at 10 AM.

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:56.400
Where are the other guys?

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:58.720
Huh? They're not here yet?

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:02.370
Isshin-kun and his friend left some time ago.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:03.260
What?

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:06.480
Yuiga-dono outwitted us again.

00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:08.830
That guy is really...

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:27.730
President Yuiga?

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:29.980
Shame on me.

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:34.800
I am sorry.

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:36.870
When Nanana's Collection 
is in front of me,

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:39.910
I just can't help wanting to make it mine.

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:42.870
So, what were the ruins like?

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:45.370
I think these ruins are well-suited to you.

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:18.030
The blocks are rigged up to move.

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:20.820
If you don't follow the 
correct route, you fall.

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:23.450
The water here is about 
as warm as the hot spring,

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:26.290
but the farther out you go,
 the hotter it gets.

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:29.290
Hm. Well, for starters, get going.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:36.250
<i>Ooh!</i>

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:37.300
<i>Wait, no!</i>

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:42.760
Ow...

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:44.720
Very erotic, Hoshino-kouhai.

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:48.310
Are you all right?

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:57.710
Isshin-sama! I'm not all right!

00:11:57.710 --> 00:11:59.280
But I don't have to worry about you.

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:05.320
Right.

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:10.040
Why me?!

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:20.670
This is quite the simple setup.

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:23.090
Looks like I won't get a turn.

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:28.770
Isn't he getting full of himself?

00:12:28.770 --> 00:12:30.260
He's the man for the job.

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:32.180
We'll rely on Kagetora this time.

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:33.820
Leave it to me!

00:12:33.820 --> 00:12:35.550
I won't make the same mistake twice!

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:39.110
I'm always relying on everyone else...

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:45.360
Nice try!

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:46.070
What?!

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:54.420
Are you okay?

00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:57.380
Yeah. No big deal.

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:02.350
Uh, that's...

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:03.200
Tensai!

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:06.010
Crap!

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:18.690
Tensai! You okay?

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:20.680
I'm just fine.

00:13:20.680 --> 00:13:22.150
But, Juugo...

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:26.740
You seem oddly familiar with this.

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:29.200
Just a fluke.

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:37.830
That's hot...

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:45.700
I'll go.

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:47.890
If you fall here, you'll be in trouble.

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.810
If I screw up, take care of the rest.

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:53.770
Then I'll go left!

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:55.640
<i>Why?!</i>

00:13:58.420 --> 00:13:59.650
Wrong way!

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:07.740
I told you I'd go...

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:08.970
Yeah. Bad call.

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:31.050
This is part of Nanana's Collection?

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:50.200
Well, shall we head back?

00:14:57.630 --> 00:14:59.240
After a break, perhaps.

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:03.500
Yama-kun,

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:07.110
I'd like to go talk to 
Nanana-san after this. May I?

00:15:07.110 --> 00:15:09.260
Sure. That would make Nanana-chan happy.

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:19.940
Tsurezure-senpai,
 those are some serious muscles.

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:22.020
You look pretty ripped yourself.

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:24.760
Why don't you try some
 muscle building, too, Isshin?

00:15:24.760 --> 00:15:26.410
Look at those skinny arms.

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.580
C'mon, quit touching me.

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:31.910
Oh, Isshin-sama!

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:34.680
Ah, this water's great.

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:36.850
I could stand it a bit hotter.

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:38.450
Don't play tough!

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:41.600
Hey! You're splashing it on me!

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:50.070
Ibara-dono, peeking is a crime.

00:15:50.070 --> 00:15:52.010
I'm only looking out for the one I love!

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:54.410
Understood.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.280
Isshin-sama...

00:15:58.280 --> 00:16:00.850
Why won't you look this way?

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:06.690
Move, second-year. I'll kill you.

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:08.680
Enjoy.

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:11.280
Well, I'm going to get out.

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:18.700
Yama, come back.

00:16:19.690 --> 00:16:20.550
Yes?

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:26.960
Smooch, smooch, smooch, Tensai...

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:28.920
Ah, hot!

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:38.720
It's gone...

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:43.190
The Nanana's Collection treasure is gone!

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:48.110
So, while we were in the hot spring,

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:50.800
Yumi-san and Misaki-san were cleaning,

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:53.530
the proprietress was organizing 
accounts at the front desk,

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:55.820
and Daruku-kun was bathing in the room.

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:58.550
Shizuka-san was resting in her room,

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:00.790
And Fugi-san was playing 
in the recreation hall.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:04.500
<b>Women                    Men</b>

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:03.880
But no suspicious persons were seen?

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:04.500
Correct.

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:06.610
I see...

00:17:06.610 --> 00:17:11.960
But considering the circumstances, 
who else could it be but you?

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:13.940
Wait a minute!

00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:17.870
It's true that Yuki-chan is 
antisocial and unapproachable,

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:20.340
but she wouldn't steal from someone!

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:21.970
I agree.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:24.180
Yukihime-neesan didn't do it.

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:26.480
Hm. If that's what you say,

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:29.060
I'd love to hear your reasons.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:30.860
Where were you?!

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:34.080
I was eliminating other possibilities

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:36.640
to prove the validity of my own deduction.

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:37.610
What?

00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:41.620
The thief is in this room.

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:47.330
I'd like to ask you a
 few questions, Fugi-dono.

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:49.540
Besides Juugo and the other two,

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:53.010
was there no one else entering or 
leaving the men's changing room?

00:17:56.020 --> 00:17:57.030
There was.

00:17:57.030 --> 00:17:58.840
Huh? Then why...

00:17:58.840 --> 00:17:59.760
Tensai!

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:01.240
I found it!

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:04.780
That's what we found in the ruins!

00:18:05.090 --> 00:18:07.560
Daruku, where was it?

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:09.990
It was buried among the laundry.

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:17.120
You didn't suspect the person 
entering the men's bathing area

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:18.940
because it was an employee.

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:20.530
Correct, Fugi-dono?

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:22.280
Yes, that's correct.

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:24.050
This is my last question.

00:18:24.050 --> 00:18:25.760
Who was that employee?

00:18:26.320 --> 00:18:27.750
The one standing over there.

00:18:29.450 --> 00:18:31.730
Which means that you are the thief,

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:32.800
Misaki Kamome!

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:35.780
Please, wait!

00:18:35.780 --> 00:18:38.420
Why would I steal a stuffed toy like that?

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:40.850
I know. You don't need 
to finish that thought,

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:42.430
phantom thief Hundred-Faces.

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:45.140
Are you serious?

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:49.270
Man, how did you know it was me?

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:52.100
You mean it really was you?

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:53.270
I amaze myself!

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:55.180
You were guessing?

00:18:55.180 --> 00:18:57.530
Well, anyway, I guess I blew it.

00:18:57.530 --> 00:19:02.180
Ma'am, please be sure to give my 
pay to the real Misaki Kamome-chan.

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:04.160
I borrowed her appearance without asking.

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:12.170
Kagetora.

00:19:13.780 --> 00:19:15.040
You don't have to chase him.

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:22.300
Too bad for you.

00:19:25.590 --> 00:19:27.670
What is, master detective?

00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:29.600
You teamed up with those two

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:32.520
to try to take the Nanana's 
Collection treasure, right?

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:37.310
I knew something was off when 
you said you failed at that job,

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:40.300
but still managed to pay your utility bill.

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:41.710
And why?

00:19:41.710 --> 00:19:42.530
Why?

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:46.210
You leaked the information 
about the ruins to Matsuri

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:47.710
and got paid for it.

00:19:47.710 --> 00:19:49.400
I see. And?

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:51.770
You had the two Matsuri 
members wait in the inn,

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:54.620
and after we acquired the treasure,

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:56.630
they waited for a chance to steal it.

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:59.270
The girl, Fugi Yukihime, was a decoy.

00:19:59.270 --> 00:20:01.870
The plan was to have
 Hundred-Faces retrieve the treasure

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:05.890
while everyone was busy 
eyeing her with suspicion.

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:08.290
That's quite a deduction.

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:12.110
But why didn't you name me
 or Matsuri as the guilty party?

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:15.110
I had no material evidence.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:19.660
Besides, this data could prove 
advantageous to me next time.

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:23.530
Is that why you pretended to make a 
correct guess about Misaki Kamome?

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:26.150
I'll give you this: I'm impressed.

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:28.310
You saw right through me, my rival!

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:31.590
Isn't that something a villain 
is supposed to say?

00:20:37.520 --> 00:20:40.590
Yuiga-kun... this isn't
 part of Nanana's Collection.

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:42.790
Wait a second!

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:46.100
That stuffed toy was definitely
 inside the treasure chest in the ruins!

00:20:46.690 --> 00:20:49.060
But I don't know anything about this.

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:51.520
So... it's a fake?

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:56.230
Hm. That must mean 
someone had already taken

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:58.610
the Nanana's Collection treasure.

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:00.530
The one in the treasure chest was a dummy?

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:20.100
<i>She's really mad.</i>

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:24.350
Hurry up and get here...
